{"2280720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mellow Island Mess", "steam_appid": 2280720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mellow Island Mess is a short 2.5D retro-styled adventure game - jump, swim, and glide your way around the world to put a stop to the slime that's spreading across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxed platforming with branching paths, lots of characters to meet and over 30 quests to complete</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐨 New Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From moles to foxes, parrots to pigs, squirrels to turtles, there's many animals to meet and help!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 Complete Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue a lost climber ⛰️, deliver a love letter 💌, calm an eel 🐍, collect bat poop 💩, conduct a toad choir 🎵, find the best sandwich filling 🥪, with more than 30 quests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Learn Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new areas by learning new skills, like how to glide from some tree frogs or how to jump extra high by a kangaroo!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mellow Island Mess is a short 2.5D retro-styled adventure game - jump, swim, and glide your way around the world to put a stop to the slime that's spreading across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxed platforming with branching paths, lots of characters to meet and over 30 quests to complete</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐨 New Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From moles to foxes, parrots to pigs, squirrels to turtles, there's many animals to meet and help!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 Complete Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue a lost climber ⛰️, deliver a love letter 💌, calm an eel 🐍, collect bat poop 💩, conduct a toad choir 🎵, find the best sandwich filling 🥪, with more than 30 quests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Learn Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new areas by learning new skills, like how to glide from some tree frogs or how to jump extra high by a kangaroo!</p>", "short_description": "Mellow Island Mess is a 2.5D retro-styled adventure game - run, jump, swim, and glide your way around the world to find and stop the slime that's spreading across the land. Help friends along the way, completing quests, uncovering secret areas and learning new abilities!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280720/e69e21091be0d9fdb1ade4b4aaca6397be202ab0/header.jpg?t=1768826317", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280720/57b61e29a4ee7863a949090168f2b9ce6b86fe7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768826317", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280720/57b61e29a4ee7863a949090168f2b9ce6b86fe7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768826317", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Joseph Mahon"], "publishers": ["Joseph Mahon"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280720/2c7ab95318ab0d2e077b16788aca69d13c4d01f7/ss_2c7ab95318ab0d2e077b16788aca69d13c4d01f7.600x338.jpg?t=1768